cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "leica-fret-quant: Leica Confocal FRET Quantification with Light/Dark Comparison"
abstract: >-
  Batch quantification of Leica confocal sensitized-emission FRET images with
  light/dark comparison.
  Parses light/dark groups, computes FOV-level and per-cell FRET indices
  (including FRETN normalization), exports statistical CSVs, publication-grade
  bar charts, and per-FOV pseudo-color imaging with original grayscale TIFFs.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "豆ger"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dougerr/leica-fret-quant"
keywords:
  - FRET
  - FRETN
  - confocal microscopy
  - Leica
  - image quantification
  - optogenetics
  - light/dark comparison
  - agent skills
